{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FLnYvYPDHXq7qpUCDy249Y","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, the JIRA issue that tracks KIP-1308 \\\\\\\"Extend RecordHeader API for Common Value Types\\\\\\\" from the Apache Kafka mailing list thread by Aditya Kousik on 2026-04-01 is:\\\\n\\\\n**KAFKA-20387**\\\\n\\\\nThis issue was created on 2026-03-31 by Aditya Kousik (the day before the mailing list discussion) with the title \\\\\\\"Extend RecordHeader API for Common Value Types.\\\\\\\" The issue description references KIP-1308 and describes the need to add static factories and typed accessors for common types used in RecordHeader values.\\\\n\\\\n**Files cited:**\\\\n- `/store/events/2026/03/31/jira-13646870-created-3fcf3efc.md` - JIRA issue creation record\\\\n- `/store/events/2026/04/01/mail-8a3a21f2b90819312447f34e-befe816b.md` - Aditya Kousik's mailing list message on 2026-04-01\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"events/2026/04/01/mail-614b392ebde601c1f3f1971e-908f5d4a.md\\\",\\\"events/2026/04/01/mail-8a3a21f2b90819312447f34e-befe816b.md\\\",\\\"events/2026/03/31/jira-13646870-created-3fcf3efc.md\\\",\\\"events/2026/03/31/jira-13646870-change-23002942-0-0f058700.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":15.2,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":3,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":59083,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":9526,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.0308673,\\\"input_tokens\\\":42,\\\"output_tokens\\\":1173}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ac5c908f-e1e1-4ce8-9fcc-6747d7c22156","uuid":"0665536e-2ea5-4821-abeb-1aca4d02fadf","timestamp":"2026-09-27T19:45:15.149Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, the JIRA issue that tracks KIP-1308 \\\\\\\"Extend RecordHeader API for Common Value Types\\\\\\\" from the Apache Kafka mailing list thread by Aditya Kousik on 2026-04-01 is:\\\\n\\\\n**KAFK